[10.474335, "o", "/app\r\n--- BAY_NOTES ---\r\n"]
[10.475793, "o", "Kiln CLI lives at /app/bin/kilncli.\r\n\r\nSubcommands:\r\n  impress PATH  apply every *.sql under /app/inkstack/migrations/ onto PATH\r\n  spill         fill /app/vats/worker.vat for assay\r\n  assay         read /app/vats/worker.vat, print schema_version, write /app/vats/assay.ok on success\r\n\r\nThe Makefile at /app/Makefile ships /app/bin/kilncli from the kilncli module.\r\n\r\nSources that implement those subcommands:\r\n  /app/hopsrc/imprint\r\n  /app/claybin\r\n  /app/scorepit\r\n\r\nLedger intent: /app/inkstack/intent.toml\r\nWorkspace vat path used by local experiments: /app/hearth/focus.txt\r\n"]
[10.476039, "o", "--- top-level ---\r\n"]
[10.482387, "o", "/app/Makefile\r\n/app/baydocs/BAY_NOTES.txt\r\n/app/baydocs/OPS.txt\r\n/app/bin/kilncli\r\n/app/claybin/borrow.go\r\n/app/claybin/emit.go\r\n/app/go.mod\r\n/app/hearth/focus.txt\r\n/app/inkstack/intent.toml\r\n/app/kilncli/cmd_assay.go\r\n/app/kilncli/cmd_impress.go"]
[10.482546, "o", "\r\n/app/kilncli/cmd_spill.go\r\n/app/kilncli/main.go\r\n/app/scorepit/score.go\r\n/app/scorepit/shim.go\r\n/app/vats/bench.vat\r\n/app/vats/mold.vat\r\n/app/vats/plaster.vat\r\n/app/vats/worker.vat\r\n"]
[10.48276, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@631e5ebb082a:/app# "]
